# Part 2 — strategy

Portfolio = 1/3 of capital per ticker, 1× notional per trade; Sharpe/ann./maxDD/worst on daily portfolio returns
(all eligible days); avg bp and hit per trade; t(day) = t across dates of the mean trade that date.

